# The Point tool's x and y typed fast after Tab, before the field has the
# keyboard: x is 2.5, its second part typed on the frame the field takes
# the keyboard and Tab on the next; then y, 1, and Enter, which places the
# point at once.
open docs/instances/sketch-basic.json
wait 16
action tool.point
wait 2
move 760 300 3
wait 2
key Tab
text "2"
wait 1
text ".5"
key Tab
text "1"
key Enter
wait 4
